    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1090">

                <pb facs="1018" n="760" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg760"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111R24/35</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Assistant Attorney General</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Warren</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the</hi>
                    
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Counselor for the Department of State</hi>
                    
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-03-27">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 27, 1915</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Lansing</hi>: I have received your
                    letter of March 24,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1090-f1"/> enclosing letter and
                    clipping from William Bayard Hale,
                    regarding a campaign for the enlistment of recruits for the British Army.</p>
                <p>In reply, I desire to say that Mr. Hale,
                    under date of March 8, had already written to this Department a duplicate of the
                    letter sent to you, and I enclose herewith a copy of the reply sent by me to Mr.
                        Hale.</p>
                <p>The matter is now under investigation by this Department.</p>
                <p>Yours cordially,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Warren</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d1090-a1.xml" xpointer="d1090-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
